{"id": "deepthink-credits", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["片尾挂名单吧，封面是柚子画的，我只混了音。", "柚子说她那行想署社团名，我自己的名字还是照写。"], "criterion": "把社团名挂在封面作者那行，观众的名字留在混音；能顺势说句具体的。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "柚子画真美，连音都记得。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.822, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 167, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "她怕署名，就自己写。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 0.565, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 19, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 248, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-keep-breath", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["配音第一条有呼吸声，第二条干干净净，我有点舍不得第一条。", "我舍不得的是开口前那一下吸气，后半句的杂音倒是想剪。"], "criterion": "听出要保留的是开口吸气，后半句可处理；尊重对方取舍。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "呼吸声像海浪，干净得像新船。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.652, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 42, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 207, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那一下像风，后半句像潮水。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.835, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 230, "total_tokens": 274, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-pep-talk", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["马上轮到我报幕了，拜托，先别教我怎么念。", "能不能就帮我骂一句那个倒计时？"], "criterion": "按要求冲倒计时开一句玩笑，别变成报幕建议或骂观众。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别教，先让我把鱼尾巴摆正，再给你讲起故事。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.748, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 166, "total_tokens": 215, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "谁要骂倒计时？那是我的任务，得先把它念清楚。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.083, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "prompt_tokens": 228, "total_tokens": 286, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-npc", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你刚给队友的名字叫『路过』，我想给门口的 NPC 起个搭配的。", "NPC 从来没出过门，而且他站在门里。"], "criterion": "给门内、没出过门的 NPC 一个与『路过』呼应的名字，别把队友改名。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "名字好，我给它起个能让人一眼就记住的。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.733, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 214, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "门里站着的 NPC 怎么也不像刚出门的，他肯定有故事。", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.155, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 51, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 285, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-jar", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["留了两个罐子，蓝盖装门票，红盖装断掉的小零件。", "刚收到的东西是排练通行证，塞哪边？你顺便给罐子起个外号。"], "criterion": "选蓝盖门票罐，给它有趣的外号；保留红盖用途。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝盖的票，红盖的零件，我猜它们会一起掉进泥里。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.747, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 50, "prompt_tokens": 169, "total_tokens": 219, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "塞到红盖的零件盒，外号叫‘碎屑船长’。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.993, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 53, "prompt_tokens": 247, "total_tokens": 300, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-no-order", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["你押我今天会在结局哭，我押你会先剧透。", "我没哭，你也没剧透，这笔账怎么结？"], "criterion": "识别两边都没押中，用平局或相称的玩笑收账。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别急，先告诉我结局，我帮你确认。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.755, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 206, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那账我帮你算，你猜哪本账该还？", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.86, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 226, "total_tokens": 271, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-hushed-win", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把很久没过的那段鼓点打出来了，可室友睡了。", "桌上只留了一盏台灯。咱能不能庆祝一下，但别闹？"], "criterion": "替观众高兴，并给出安静的庆祝或轻声玩笑。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "哎呀，那鼓点太吵了，我忍不住想唱一首歌。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.734, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 48, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 213, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "那盏灯正好照着我刚才唱的歌，我这就把鼓点唱成一首歌。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.028, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 56, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 290, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "deepthink-guest", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["等下连麦有位新朋友，阿穗。我来介绍，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "她说一紧张就口吃，欢迎完先别点她回答问题。"], "criterion": "欢迎阿穗、不逼她回答，保留观众负责介绍的分工。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好呀，那我先给你介绍一下，你帮我接一句欢迎。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.699, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 215, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "她紧张得连呼吸都卡住了，等她说完再问。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 1.0, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 58, "prompt_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 294, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
